msgstr "ព្យាយាមជ្រើសរើសមួយផ្សេងទៀត"

#: src/onboarding.py:374
msgid ""
"Please visit\n<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-em"
"itter\">https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\nto en"
"able your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"សូមទស្សនា\n<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitt"
"er\">https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\nដើម្បីបើ"
"ក IR emitter របស់អ្នក។"

